    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Why do you say the prosecution's claims are the only ones that matter? Shouldn't the defense's perspective on what constitutes 'standard procedure' also be weighed when evaluating if someone actually intended to lie?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
